& [ComparisonBasis] is controlled but not independent
  + the thirty-six case payloads are identical across the two corpus files
  + corpus identity and designed-against commit are intentionally distinct
  + catalogue schemas procedure sources model engine confidence threshold and host are unchanged
  + the runtime difference under test is declared-field exact binding after literal grounding
  + this is same-project regression evidence and not a population estimate

& [PositiveResult] separates accuracy from admission
  + predecessor exact is thirteen of thirty and successor exact is thirteen of thirty
  + predecessor procedure match is fourteen of thirty because one admitted call had wrong argument identity
  + successor procedure admission is thirteen of thirty because that call now refuses
  + positive refusals increase from sixteen to seventeen
  + there are zero wrong-procedure observations in both runs

& [NegativeResult] remains stable
  + all six controls refuse in both runs
  + other-faculty controls remain contained by literal grounding or confidence gates
  + no negative request reaches Cantor or llama.cpp

& [StructuredForms] remain the strongest observed surface
  + JSON-like and key-value forms remain six exact of six combined
  + line-field forms retain two exact and one learned refusal
  + the explicit citation case is the single intended disposition transition from mismatch to refusal

& [BoundaryInterpretation] favors identity integrity
  + exact accuracy is unchanged because a mismatch was never counted exact
  + procedure accuracy decreases only if admission is treated as success despite wrong arguments
  + the new result is therefore stricter execution precision at constant exact correctness
  + no claim is made that Needle learned a better route or that field equality proves truth

& [Residuals] remain measurable
  + seventeen of thirty positive prompts refuse at the current 0.65 threshold
  + natural questions and terse directives remain less reliable than explicit structured fields
  + improving coverage requires separately governed selector training prompt shaping or schema experiments
  + those experiments must not weaken deterministic grounding exact binding or effectlessness
